{"pageid":3457,"title":"Version 1.13.0","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Version 1.13.0</span>","revid":15564,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.13.0\">Version 1.13.0</span></h2>\n<p><b>June 28th, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"New_Content:\">New Content:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Added brand new <a href=\"/wiki/Ladder\" title=\"Ladder\">ladder schematic</a>!</li>\n<li>Added brand new <a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Store\" title=\"Classic Store\">Classic Store</a>!</li>\n<li>Added back the <a href=\"/wiki/Ore\" title=\"Ore\">classic ore</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Tree\" title=\"Tree\">tree</a></li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Store\" title=\"Classic Store\">Classic store</a> includes an alternating table of 9 items every 12 hours!</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changes:\">Changes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Increased hotbar limit to 9 (7 prior)\",</li>\n<li>Updated the main menu screen</li>\n<li>Mike is now riskily standing upon scaffolding, and has changed attitudes</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Fixed issue where tools would activate when moving the camera on mobile</li>\n<li>Fixed driving UI showing if the vehicle was despawned whilst driving</li>\n<li>Fixed glitch that allowed you to collect multiple <a href=\"/wiki/Fireflies\" title=\"Fireflies\">fireflies</a> at once</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163725\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.016 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 16/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansi